00:07:42.802 --> 00:07:46.521
And sometimes months when we
can't get that full eight hours

00:07:46.521 --> 00:07:48.341
when we're just go, go, go?

00:07:48.341 --> 00:07:49.681
Thanks guys.

00:07:49.681 --> 00:07:50.989
- Thank you so much.

00:07:50.989 --> 00:07:55.903
First of all if something
happens and you are shipping a

00:07:55.903 --> 00:07:57.762
product are about
to get something,--

00:07:57.762 --> 00:08:00.065
- Moments in time.
- Moments in time.

00:08:00.065 --> 00:08:03.045
This is a moment in time and
you didn't get your full night's

00:08:03.045 --> 00:08:07.084
sleep try and get 20 minutes of
a nap as soon as you can during

00:08:07.084 --> 00:08:08.270
the next day.

00:08:08.270 --> 00:08:10.989
It will make you more
productive the rest of the time.

00:08:10.989 --> 00:08:12.826
It resets your whole system.

00:08:14.526 --> 00:08:15.335
- I apologize.

00:08:15.335 --> 00:08:17.836
Is that a general thing because
for me I'll tell you, boy,

00:08:17.836 --> 00:08:21.054
if I took a 20, 
