- No.

00:09:29.388 --> 00:09:32.600
I now get eight
hours 95% of the time.

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:35.393
- Is that right?
What about with the travel?

00:09:35.393 --> 00:09:36.693
Like you're going
to Dallas tomorrow.

00:09:36.693 --> 00:09:40.502
- So here's the thing, I can
make sure that you get enough

00:09:40.502 --> 00:09:42.628
sleep even when you travel.

00:09:42.628 --> 00:09:44.837
You need a transition to
sleep, that's the key.

00:09:44.837 --> 00:09:48.595
This is the most important thing
I'm going to say other than the

00:09:48.595 --> 00:09:52.181
fact that the science is 
in on sleep. Right?

00:09:52.181 --> 00:09:53.585
We're not debating something.

00:09:53.585 --> 00:09:55.787
- Right, this is not subjective.
- This is not subjective.

00:09:55.787 --> 00:09:58.062
This is not some Greek
immigrant woman's--

00:09:58.062 --> 00:09:59.726
- Crazy idea.

00:09:59.726 --> 00:10:01.909
You're not from America.
Get out here with this crap.

00:10:01.909 --> 00:10:05.818
I was born in Belarus
so I have my own version.

00:10:05.818 --> 00:10:08.126
- But you have no accent
which makes me feel bad.

00:10:08.126 --> 00:10:09.473
- Well, I came when I was three.

00:10:09.473 --> 00:10:12.344
- It makes me feel I'm
tone deaf which I really am.

00:10:12.344 --> 00:10:13.293
- Go ahead.

00:10:13.293 --> 00:10:16.795
- But anyway beyond the 50 pages
of scientific endnotes the most

00:10:16.795 --> 00:10:18.171
important thing I'm going to say

00:10:18.171 --> 00:10:20.270
is that we need 
a transition to sleep.

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:23.672
If anybody who is watching
has children you know that you

00:10:23.672 --> 00:10:27.521
don't just drop your baby
and your young child to bed.

00:10:27.521 --> 00:10:31.053
You give it a bath,
you put it in PJs.

00:10:31.053 --> 00:10:32.531
You sing it a lullaby.

00:10:32.531 --> 00:10:34.855
- Do you think the modern
parents are doing way too much

00:10:34.855 --> 00:10:35.739
of that transition?

00:10:35.739 --> 00:10:36.880
- No.
- I do.

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:38.680
Some of the things have
become four hours long.

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:40.926
- Well, four hours is
a little excessive.

00:10:40.926 --> 00:10:43.672
You sound like Chelsea Handler.

00:10:43.672 --> 00:10:47.127
Modern men and women have
dropped the transition.

00:10:47.127 --> 00:10:50.804
The transition is you are
texting, emailing you put your

00:10:50.804 --> 00:10:54.736
phone by your bed you turn off
the light and then what happens

00:10:54.736 --> 00:10:57.561
is that you may be exhausted
enough to go to sleep but your

00:10:57.561 --> 00:11:00.918
brain has not been given the
opportunity to wind down so it's

00:11:00.918 --> 00:11:03.069
