way too exhausted.

00:11:28.741 --> 00:11:30.145
- Got it.
- You know what I'm saying?

00:11:30.145 --> 00:11:32.178
- It would make a lot of sense.

00:11:33.428 --> 00:11:36.214
- You remind me of me
before I collapsed.

00:11:36.214 --> 00:11:38.042
- I don't want to wake
up in a pool of blood.

00:11:38.042 --> 00:11:39.146
- Let me tell you
what happened to me.

00:11:39.146 --> 00:11:42.510
I would literally my friends
would joke that they would go to

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:46.544
a movie house with me before the
movie started I would be asleep.

00:11:46.544 --> 00:11:49.213
They would put me in a
car, I would be asleep.

00:11:49.213 --> 00:11:53.096
I was so sleep deprived that
the minute I was in any darkened

00:11:53.096 --> 00:11:56.573
place or I didn't have to
function, I would fall asleep.

00:11:56.573 --> 00:11:57.959
- I don't do that.

00:11:57.959 --> 00:12:00.222
I've actually
never fallen asleep--

00:12:00.222 --> 00:12:01.939
